[13.184439, "o", "\r\nInvestigation status: completed\r\nInvestigation summary:\r\nPrimary driver of the decline: **Small Box** (Product Container) contributed **89.41%** of the change ($15,163.38 -> $1,121.03).\r\n\r\nContributing factors:\r\n- significant decline in medium priority orders: Medium (81.83%)\r\n- large drop in Quebec region: Quebec (81.95%)\r\n"]
